title: "Glance (glance-vlm): reading typed visual judgements from a frozen open vision-language model"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakajima
    given-names: Yohei
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
url: "https://glance.yohei.me"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yoheinakajima/glance"
